Plan 1 step 1 (kubernetes): Confirm the Pod's current status, restart count, and last termination state (exit code, reason, started/finished times) for the app container
- Pod s1-app-5468546b65-gjkcl in demo-s1 is in Running phase but not Ready (ContainersNotReady), owned by ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65. [ev_ff96737437]
- The app container is in CrashLoopBackOff (waiting) with message 'back-off 40s restarting failed container', restart_count is 3. [ev_ff96737437]
- The app container's last termination state is terminated with reason Error, exit code 2, started_at 2026-10-19T22:41:25Z and finished_at 2026-10-19T22:41:25Z (same second). [ev_ff96737437]
- The app container image is docker.io/library/bianque-s1-app:dev. [ev_ff96737437]

Plan 1 step 2 (kubernetes): Check the Deployment spec for the app container's image, imagePullPolicy, command/args, probes, and resource limits
- The app container image is bianque-s1-app:dev (no registry prefix, tag dev), with no imagePullPolicy specified in the Deployment spec. [ev_67fd6463e6]
- The app container has no command or args specified in the Deployment spec. [ev_67fd6463e6]
- The app container has env vars APP_MODE=invalid and ALLOC_MB=48. [ev_67fd6463e6]
- The app container has resource limits cpu=200m, memory=128Mi and requests cpu=50m, memory=64Mi. [ev_67fd6463e6]
- The app container has a liveness probe (HTTP GET /healthz on port http, initialDelay 3s, period 5s, timeout 1s, failureThreshold 2) and a readiness probe (HTTP GET /healthz, period 5s, timeout 1s, failureThreshold 3). [ev_67fd6463e6]
- The Deployment s1-app is at revision 2 with desired=1, ready=1, available=1, unavailable=1, and the Progressing condition reports ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65 is progressing. [ev_67fd6463e6]

Plan 1 step 3 (kubernetes): List recent events for the Pod and namespace to find Back-off restarting, probe failure, or image pull errors
- Pod s1-app-5468546b65-gjkcl has a Warning BackOff event 'Back-off restarting failed container app' (count 8, first at 22:40:46Z). [ev_6d6000f56e, ev_25b03cf7e5]
- Pod s1-app-5468546b65-gjkcl has repeated Warning Unhealthy events: 'Readiness probe failed: Get http://10.244.x.x:8080/healthz: dial tcp ... connection refused' (count 6). [ev_6d6000f56e, ev_25b03cf7e5]
- No ImagePullBackOff or ErrImagePull events are present; the image bianque-s1-app:dev was 'already present on machine' (Pulled, count 4). [ev_6d6000f56e, ev_25b03cf7e5]
- The container was repeatedly Created and Started (count 4 each), consistent with crash-loop restarts. [ev_6d6000f56e]
- A prior ReplicaSet pod s1-app-666f75b99-9q7v7 also showed the same readiness probe connection-refused failure before the current ReplicaSet s1-app-5468546b65 was scaled up. [ev_25b03cf7e5]

